{
  "about": [
    "The debit as a vector: four states per irreducible, and the counter is the",
    "popcount of one of them. Two bits compose; four labels do not, which is why",
    "the state is derived and never stored.",
    "",
    "The alphabet cases enumerate a five-token palette against every interesting",
    "pair of (demanded, permitted). The interval cases are runs: the answer only",
    "changes where a boundary is, so a million values cost the same as five."
  ],
  "coverage": {
    "size": 22,
    "criterion": "every quadrant reachable, every degenerate extent, and the disjoint-writers case the convex hull gets wrong",
    "could_exclude_counterexamples": true,
    "why": "the four quadrants are a partition of the extent, so a case that lands a value in two of them, or in none, fails the partition assertion regardless of which quadrant is wrong"
  },
  "cases": [
